WEBVTT

01:47.300 --> 01:51.940
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

01:52.060 --> 01:54.980
[Episode 18]
[This story is purely fictional]

01:54.980 --> 01:59.380
[Changsha Garrison Command]

01:59.380 --> 02:02.680
[Inspector's Office]

02:02.680 --> 02:03.130
Come in.

02:07.840 --> 02:08.610
Sir.

02:09.030 --> 02:11.260
By the authority granted to me through Hunan Police Secret Transfer Order

02:11.400 --> 02:13.540
No. 47 under Provincial Garrison Command,

02:14.080 --> 02:15.380
I am here to escort the suspected Japanese sympathizer.

02:15.910 --> 02:17.340
Please stamp this

02:18.080 --> 02:19.660
so that I can transfer the individual

02:19.750 --> 02:21.500
for further interrogation by the Military Justice Department.

02:29.940 --> 02:31.740
[Suspected Japanese Sympathizer, Xie Jiu]

02:31.740 --> 02:33.220
[Transfer immediately to Defense Headquarters. Provincial Garrison Command]

02:33.430 --> 02:35.260
Zhang Qishan sure has gone out of his way.

02:40.560 --> 02:41.890
Go through the paperwork with him.

02:42.310 --> 02:43.610
Three days later, your people

02:43.680 --> 02:45.100
can come and take him away.

02:45.590 --> 02:46.220
Sir.

02:47.190 --> 02:48.500
The transfer order

02:48.870 --> 02:50.220
says immediately.

02:51.190 --> 02:52.220
Feel free to send a telegram

02:52.590 --> 02:53.730
to Nanjing for further inquiries.

02:55.080 --> 02:57.100
I am merely following the order given.

03:03.680 --> 03:04.540
Bring him to the suspect.

03:04.630 --> 03:05.100
Yes.

03:08.960 --> 03:10.130
Thank you for your cooperation, sir.

03:34.120 --> 03:34.940
You may leave now.

03:36.900 --> 03:41.540
[Xie's Residence]

03:46.470 --> 03:47.130
Ninth Master,

03:47.840 --> 03:48.570
you must have suffered a lot.

03:49.430 --> 03:50.450
Master Zhang asked me to pick you up.

03:51.310 --> 03:52.690
Is Master Zhang okay?

03:53.680 --> 03:55.100
We're heading to Beiping.

04:14.680 --> 04:15.450
Third Master.

04:16.600 --> 04:17.460
It's rare to see you here.

04:19.040 --> 04:19.780
Fourth Master.

04:20.120 --> 04:21.370
You have grown

04:21.390 --> 04:22.580
less vigilant.

04:23.870 --> 04:24.980
My ears

04:25.190 --> 04:27.170
pick up footsteps very easily.

04:27.830 --> 04:29.020
But in your case...

04:30.190 --> 04:31.340
Well, it's different.

04:37.310 --> 04:37.700
Here.

04:37.700 --> 04:38.700
[Express Ticket, Changsha to Beiping]

04:40.120 --> 04:40.730
What is the meaning of this?

04:41.950 --> 04:43.220
Master Zhang needs help in Beiping.

04:45.310 --> 04:47.810
When did you

04:48.070 --> 04:49.290
become Master Zhang's lapdog?

04:49.680 --> 04:50.140
What happened?

04:51.160 --> 04:52.020
Your clan is no more?

04:52.630 --> 04:53.930
And you're changing your family name to Zhang?

04:56.950 --> 04:58.460
You heard what Master Zhang said.

04:59.240 --> 05:00.050
The Japanese are here.

05:00.950 --> 05:02.610
I don't want this place to be affected.

05:03.560 --> 05:05.220
I want it to remain peaceful.

05:05.600 --> 05:06.290
I knew it.

05:06.800 --> 05:08.100
People with a family like you

05:08.190 --> 05:08.900
are a burden.

05:09.870 --> 05:11.050
I'm a loner.

05:11.240 --> 05:11.900
I can leave whenever.

05:12.680 --> 05:14.630
I don't care if Changsha is affected or not.

05:14.680 --> 05:16.020
You can leave.

05:16.120 --> 05:16.980
But what about your master's wife?

05:20.270 --> 05:21.100
It has been two years.

05:22.870 --> 05:24.460
And you aren't even allowed to pay respect to her.

05:25.070 --> 05:25.900
I wish I could.

05:26.160 --> 05:26.930
I don't know where Eryue Hong

05:26.950 --> 05:27.900
buried her.

05:28.160 --> 05:28.810
How can I pay respect to her then?

05:31.120 --> 05:31.810
I know where.

05:41.270 --> 05:42.050
When do we depart?

05:45.390 --> 05:46.340
The hour of Wu tomorrow.

05:47.000 --> 05:47.580
We still have time.

05:52.630 --> 05:53.250
Where are you going?

05:55.240 --> 05:56.220
To catch some crabs.

06:01.480 --> 06:02.100
Thank you, Third Master.

06:07.830 --> 06:10.100
Newspaper! Newspaper!

06:10.100 --> 06:10.900
[Fenjiu Liquor]

06:17.160 --> 06:18.020
Bugger off.

06:20.360 --> 06:20.850
Sixth Master.

06:21.800 --> 06:24.290
I brought this excellent

06:24.390 --> 06:25.850
fenjiu liquor for you.

06:26.270 --> 06:27.610
30 years old.

06:28.430 --> 06:29.460
Don't you want to try it?

06:34.750 --> 06:36.610
My posterior.

06:40.830 --> 06:41.780
Divine.

06:44.800 --> 06:45.490
Do you like it?

06:46.430 --> 06:47.220
It's good, isn't it?

06:48.160 --> 06:48.850
Sixth Master.

06:49.070 --> 06:50.100
I came

06:50.430 --> 06:51.850
with a message from Master Zhang.

06:52.680 --> 06:54.220
He needs your help

06:54.390 --> 06:55.610
in Beiping.

06:57.630 --> 06:58.340
How much?

06:59.000 --> 06:59.660
How much?

07:00.830 --> 07:01.780
It's unpaid.

07:02.120 --> 07:02.730
No, thanks.

07:04.800 --> 07:05.290
Sixth Master,

07:06.000 --> 07:07.810
you're close with Master Zhang.

07:08.190 --> 07:09.810
Let's not measure the relationship with money.

07:09.950 --> 07:10.780
I'm not going.

07:21.000 --> 07:21.490
Sixth Master.

07:24.480 --> 07:25.370
That's all I have.

07:29.480 --> 07:30.140
Tiezui.

07:31.070 --> 07:32.340
Your business is failing.

07:33.630 --> 07:34.810
This

07:35.040 --> 07:36.290
isn't even enough to buy two pots of liquor.

07:39.720 --> 07:40.250
Sixth Master.

07:40.800 --> 07:42.810
You took my money. That means you're coming.

07:45.240 --> 07:46.580
I'm not coming.

07:47.270 --> 07:48.290
Give it back then.

07:49.680 --> 07:50.850
Sixth Master,

07:52.560 --> 07:54.490
I know we hardly talk.

07:54.600 --> 07:56.290
But as part of the Mystic Nine,

07:56.560 --> 07:58.580
we always know the right thing to do.

08:06.600 --> 08:08.290
I'm not close to Laogou.

08:08.920 --> 08:09.780
I don't care

08:10.270 --> 08:11.220
if he lives or dies.

08:12.390 --> 08:13.170
The Mystic Nine is old.

08:13.680 --> 08:14.580
It's time for some changes.

08:15.630 --> 08:16.340
If he's dead,

08:16.870 --> 08:18.340
I can nominate another candidate.

08:21.920 --> 08:22.660
Sixth Master.

08:24.600 --> 08:26.140
Have I not made myself clear enough?

08:26.680 --> 08:27.930
Follow me

08:28.160 --> 08:30.020
and your scarf isn't the only thing cut in half.

08:52.240 --> 08:54.420
No wonder I couldn't convince him.

08:55.870 --> 08:58.770
Only women can move that soul.

09:03.100 --> 09:06.100
[Divination Service]

09:06.790 --> 09:07.980
Stay away

09:08.240 --> 09:09.220
from that kind of thing.

09:09.510 --> 09:10.370
It's not good for your health.

09:10.960 --> 09:12.010
Don't worry, Master Zhang.

09:12.870 --> 09:13.730
I am fine.

09:13.960 --> 09:14.730
Fine?

09:15.440 --> 09:16.580
You

09:17.150 --> 09:17.850
are pallid.

09:21.440 --> 09:22.220
Master Zhang?

09:23.270 --> 09:24.130
Xie Jiu?

09:31.480 --> 09:32.530
Why are you here?

09:38.600 --> 09:39.220
Xie Jiu.

09:39.870 --> 09:41.220
I'm so glad you've been freed.

09:42.840 --> 09:43.730
Huo Wenhai

09:44.240 --> 09:45.420
has set his eyes on my house.

09:46.670 --> 09:48.580
Xie Jiu and I are departing soon.

09:48.600 --> 09:49.300
We dropped by to check on you.

09:50.150 --> 09:51.300
Have you talked to Chen Pi and Heibei?

09:53.120 --> 09:53.980
Li

09:55.030 --> 09:56.100
went to talk to Chen Pi.

09:57.480 --> 09:58.420
As for Heibei...

10:00.670 --> 10:02.420
You can count on me.

10:04.480 --> 10:05.730
My divination said that this trip

10:06.440 --> 10:07.370
would be a good trip.

10:08.150 --> 10:10.490
The wealth line is dim,

10:11.360 --> 10:12.730
but as long as we have enough money,

10:13.200 --> 10:15.820
it will be a fruitful trip, Master Zhang.

10:18.720 --> 10:19.180
Ninth Master.

10:20.030 --> 10:20.300
Here.

10:24.600 --> 10:26.100
Everyone knows that the auction

10:26.200 --> 10:28.060
in Xinyue Restaurant is an avatar of avarice.

10:28.550 --> 10:30.490
Many have squandered away their wealth

10:30.510 --> 10:31.530
to be famous there.

10:32.870 --> 10:33.820
Without enough money,

10:34.360 --> 10:35.580
our trip will be in vain.

10:37.790 --> 10:39.180
The Ministry of War is watching me closely.

10:39.510 --> 10:40.370
I cannot do much.

10:40.480 --> 10:41.580
I've leveraged the cash,

10:42.270 --> 10:42.820
the gold,

10:43.630 --> 10:44.220
and the deeds

10:44.600 --> 10:45.340
I have,

10:46.150 --> 10:46.890
but they are not enough.

10:48.030 --> 10:48.980
I have mobilized

10:49.320 --> 10:50.980
every asset I have too.

10:51.840 --> 10:53.130
If it's anything like the last time,

10:53.960 --> 10:54.980
it's still far from enough.

10:58.000 --> 10:59.610
This is what I've been saying.

10:59.870 --> 11:00.530
Where

11:01.240 --> 11:02.940
are we supposed to find a rich,

11:03.320 --> 11:04.340
foolish person to help us?

11:04.600 --> 11:05.130
Right?

11:08.120 --> 11:09.250
At this point,

11:10.080 --> 11:11.770
we have to raise funds among ourselves.

11:12.600 --> 11:13.700
In Changsha,

11:14.550 --> 11:15.980
the Mystic Nine

11:16.870 --> 11:18.180
is the most affluent.

11:20.080 --> 11:21.100
If we all

11:21.750 --> 11:22.580
pool our money together,

11:23.240 --> 11:24.420
it won't be a problem.

11:25.720 --> 11:27.370
Xie Jiu's idea is great, Master Zhang.

11:27.670 --> 11:28.220
Look.

11:28.510 --> 11:29.890
Hong, Li, and Xiangu,

11:30.000 --> 11:31.130
can all contribute a little.

11:32.720 --> 11:34.100
Well, you already know my situation.

11:34.550 --> 11:36.180
I spent all my money last time

11:36.480 --> 11:38.220
in Xinyue Restaurant.

11:38.600 --> 11:39.940
I'm penniless now.

11:44.630 --> 11:45.250
Tiezui.

11:46.360 --> 11:47.100
I know

11:47.720 --> 11:48.700
life

11:49.000 --> 11:49.700
can be tough.

11:50.320 --> 11:50.700
You know what?

11:51.360 --> 11:52.300
If you

11:52.630 --> 11:53.610
no longer have a place to stay,

11:54.910 --> 11:55.890
you can stay with me.

11:57.670 --> 11:58.940
You can also stay with me.

12:06.200 --> 12:06.770
Let's go there.

12:06.790 --> 12:07.820
[Zuiyue Pleasure House]
You haven't come here for a while.

12:07.840 --> 12:09.340
Exactly. I've missed you.

12:09.750 --> 12:10.850
[Zuiyue Pleasure House]
I've been busy.

12:10.910 --> 12:12.340
- Come in. - Quick. Come in.

12:46.780 --> 12:48.410
Where are you going to change your habit

12:48.910 --> 12:50.180
of climbing through the window?

12:52.080 --> 12:54.300
I'll have to pay if I enter through the entrance.

12:54.960 --> 12:56.700
I finally earned some coins.

12:57.030 --> 12:58.530
If I give them away, I won't be able to afford you.

13:05.340 --> 13:08.620
[Ms. Bai]

13:16.720 --> 13:17.770
I'll go inside to rest up.

13:29.150 --> 13:31.250
I've already paid up. Why can't I go inside?

13:32.670 --> 13:34.130
Are you trying to say it's over between us?

13:45.270 --> 13:46.530
You're not sleeping here today.

13:47.320 --> 13:48.530
Because you have a place you should visit.

13:54.390 --> 13:56.460
Did that seer come here to talk to you?

14:01.080 --> 14:01.610
Where are you going?

14:02.390 --> 14:03.220
To kill him.

14:03.390 --> 14:05.000
There are many seers in Changsha.

14:05.000 --> 14:05.890
Can you kill them all?

14:07.510 --> 14:08.650
Eighth Master never fools around

14:09.510 --> 14:10.650
with his divination.

14:12.510 --> 14:13.650
If he says you should go,

14:15.480 --> 14:16.370
you must go.

14:17.840 --> 14:20.220
I don't care about his divination.

14:21.030 --> 14:22.460
This is no longer a personal matter.

14:23.320 --> 14:24.220
Fifth Master,

14:24.840 --> 14:25.650
that peculiar tower,

14:26.360 --> 14:27.580
and the Japanese inside.

14:28.840 --> 14:30.060
If what he said is true,

14:31.480 --> 14:33.010
the entire Changsha

14:34.030 --> 14:35.010
will be affected.

14:35.550 --> 14:36.820
I don't care.

14:37.510 --> 14:38.940
The world is in chaos.

14:39.790 --> 14:40.890
I'm too lazy to care.

14:42.000 --> 14:43.890
Then, don't show your face here anymore.

14:52.750 --> 14:54.100
So you've decided

14:54.480 --> 14:56.130
to side with Zhang Qishan today.

15:01.120 --> 15:02.370
The world forced me to make this decision.

15:05.440 --> 15:06.420
No one had a choice.

15:20.270 --> 15:21.300
Help Zhang Qishan

15:22.510 --> 15:23.700
and this world will have

15:24.790 --> 15:26.580
fewer people who have to commodify themselves as I did.

15:31.630 --> 15:32.530
If you return alive,

15:33.670 --> 15:34.490
I'll leave with you.

15:35.630 --> 15:36.460
We'll go wherever you want.

15:37.510 --> 15:38.650
I won't stay here.

15:40.240 --> 15:41.060
I'll stay at our home.

15:47.220 --> 15:49.320
[Pear Garden]

15:49.320 --> 15:49.820
Sanshui,

15:51.150 --> 15:52.300
give Master Zhang

15:52.360 --> 15:53.420
all the money and deeds

15:54.000 --> 15:55.100
I have.

15:56.120 --> 15:56.850
Master, this is...

15:57.030 --> 15:57.530
Now.

15:58.200 --> 15:58.610
Yes.

16:02.510 --> 16:03.100
Second Master.

16:04.670 --> 16:06.490
You're giving everything you have.

16:07.670 --> 16:10.420
Master Zhang spent all his money to save Yatou back then.

16:11.440 --> 16:12.420
It'll be ungrateful of me

16:13.030 --> 16:13.850
to not do the same

16:14.550 --> 16:15.610
when Master Zhang needs my help.

16:16.200 --> 16:16.770
Besides,

16:17.390 --> 16:20.530
we're up against the Japanese now.

16:26.790 --> 16:27.370
Eighth Master.

16:29.960 --> 16:30.460
Okay.

16:35.320 --> 16:35.940
Third Master.

16:44.870 --> 16:45.300
Ticket, please.

16:45.300 --> 16:46.390
[Changsha Station]

16:46.390 --> 16:46.820
Here.

16:47.150 --> 16:47.850
Okay. Go inside.

16:49.150 --> 16:49.730
All right.

16:50.360 --> 16:50.730
Come.

16:51.440 --> 16:51.890
Master Zhang.

16:52.630 --> 16:53.800
While we have raised

16:53.800 --> 16:54.980
1.94 million silver coins,

16:55.440 --> 16:56.730
if things don't go smoothly

16:57.120 --> 16:58.700
in Xinyue Restaurant,

16:59.870 --> 17:01.130
it might still not be enough.

17:02.120 --> 17:02.770
We're out of options.

17:03.840 --> 17:05.010
Let's cross the bridge when we get there.

17:10.590 --> 17:11.140
Tiezui.

17:15.920 --> 17:16.380
Where is he?

17:18.270 --> 17:19.090
On the way.

17:19.270 --> 17:20.090
He'll be here soon.

17:21.510 --> 17:22.180
Are you sure?

17:25.110 --> 17:25.770
I'm not sure.

17:28.440 --> 17:28.900
Quick.

17:29.720 --> 17:30.180
Quick.

17:30.720 --> 17:31.250
Over here.

17:32.000 --> 17:33.010
We all want different things.

17:33.830 --> 17:34.770
I can't force him.

17:36.270 --> 17:38.940
You can never count on Tiezui anyway.

17:39.590 --> 17:40.180
Chen Pi!

17:40.880 --> 17:41.420
Master Zhang.

17:53.510 --> 17:54.140
Sixth Master!

17:55.070 --> 17:56.460
Finally, you're here, Sixth Master.

17:57.030 --> 17:57.940
You're here.

17:58.310 --> 18:00.050
If you come a second later, the train will depart.

18:01.000 --> 18:02.250
How righteous of you.

18:03.440 --> 18:06.290
Let's find out if people are more generous towards a beggar in Beiping.

18:07.350 --> 18:07.810
Sixth Master.

18:08.400 --> 18:08.810
Thank you.

18:10.440 --> 18:11.860
As stubborn as a donkey.

18:13.680 --> 18:15.660
I heard Tiezui went to Ms. Bai.

18:16.070 --> 18:17.770
One word from that old pimp

18:17.960 --> 18:19.290
and you changed your mind.

18:19.790 --> 18:21.290
Would you like to die to my blade?

18:21.960 --> 18:23.140
Come. Bring it on.

18:23.270 --> 18:24.460
- Sixth Master. - Enough.

18:24.640 --> 18:25.700
I'd like to remind you

18:26.240 --> 18:27.250
that there are many Japanese citizens

18:27.270 --> 18:28.700
and spies in Beiping.

18:28.960 --> 18:30.090
Anything involving the Japanese

18:30.350 --> 18:32.490
will go through the Embassy of Japan.

18:33.750 --> 18:35.700
They even established a cultural center

18:36.030 --> 18:37.860
to rewrite history and misappropriate cultural relics.

18:38.590 --> 18:40.810
The center is under the Japanese Ministry of Foreign Affairs.

18:41.110 --> 18:43.180
And its man in charge is Torii Tottori.

18:44.590 --> 18:45.700
The current Beiping

18:46.160 --> 18:48.140
is not the Beiping we remember.

18:49.200 --> 18:50.460
But regardless of the changes,

18:51.270 --> 18:52.770
it is still Beiping of China.

18:56.070 --> 18:57.290
Board the train. We'll have a meeting.

19:02.940 --> 19:11.780
[Changsha Station]

19:15.920 --> 19:16.940
The Japanese influence

19:17.510 --> 19:19.570
has reached deep into Beiping.

19:20.350 --> 19:21.700
To maintain their stance, Xinyue Restaurant

19:22.350 --> 19:23.250
rents

19:23.480 --> 19:25.380
venues from the Military Affairs Commission to hold the auction.

19:26.200 --> 19:28.180
That way, the Japanese cannot interfere

19:28.360 --> 19:29.260
[Beiping Branch of the Military Affairs Commission]
and cause trouble.

19:29.480 --> 19:30.530
That's why the invitation letter

19:30.920 --> 19:32.140
is very important.

19:33.350 --> 19:34.180
My wife told me

19:34.510 --> 19:35.380
that the first invitation letter

19:35.750 --> 19:37.380
was on the Chief Editor of Yahe Monthly,

19:37.400 --> 19:38.460
Liang Bencai.

19:39.160 --> 19:40.010
Yahe Monthly

19:40.010 --> 19:41.420
[Yahe Monthly Publishing House]
is just a front sponsored by the Japanese.

19:42.030 --> 19:43.940
Liang Bencai studies antiquities.

19:44.550 --> 19:46.220
The Japanese used someone like him

19:46.590 --> 19:48.770
to smuggle the Chinese antiquities back home.

19:49.110 --> 19:51.940
Master Zhang and I will disguise ourselves as Mantetsu agents.

19:52.270 --> 19:53.700
We will confiscate his invitation letter by claiming

19:53.920 --> 19:55.180
that he is suspected of bribery.

19:55.350 --> 19:57.220
Then, we will order him to stay put

19:57.310 --> 19:58.530
and never contact the outside world.

19:58.790 --> 20:00.250
If he doesn't believe you and resists?

20:00.440 --> 20:01.570
It has to work.

20:01.920 --> 20:03.490
[Yahe Monthly]
Otherwise, we'll be wanted city-wide.

20:04.070 --> 20:05.250
Yahe Monthly Publishing House

20:05.250 --> 20:06.570
[Yahe Monthly Publishing House]
is situated in the center of the Japanese Residential Area.

20:06.830 --> 20:08.290
There are 8,400 guards in the vicinity.

20:08.790 --> 20:10.940
Our operation has to be successful.

20:11.830 --> 20:12.700
The second invitation letter

20:12.830 --> 20:14.140
is on a Jiangxi native

20:14.830 --> 20:16.460
called Xiong Lichang.

20:16.830 --> 20:18.860
[Zhengyang Pavilion]
He lives in Zhengyang Pavilion.

20:20.070 --> 20:23.380
Chen Pi, Heibei, you'll be in charge of him.

20:24.480 --> 20:25.490
Get his invitation letter

20:26.160 --> 20:27.180
and impersonate him.

20:29.240 --> 20:29.660
Master Zhang.

20:30.070 --> 20:31.420
You have assigned the task to the rest.

20:31.790 --> 20:33.290
What about Stinky Yu and me?

20:33.790 --> 20:34.860
You two will just take the money.

20:35.440 --> 20:36.420
We'll operate separately.

20:41.310 --> 20:42.250
You were imprisoned for a long time.

20:43.480 --> 20:44.980
Have you found the answer to the question

20:45.640 --> 20:46.490
that has been bothering you?

20:48.790 --> 20:49.660
How do you know

20:49.720 --> 20:50.860
I've been thinking about it?

20:51.480 --> 20:52.490
It is a tough question

20:52.960 --> 20:53.770
to answer.

20:56.070 --> 20:56.660
Indeed.

20:58.350 --> 20:59.250
I've been thinking,

21:00.310 --> 21:01.490
the time is changing.

21:02.350 --> 21:03.660
The Mystic Nine has survived this long.

21:04.880 --> 21:06.090
What does our future lead to?

21:09.160 --> 21:10.530
Do you want to hear my answer?

21:11.310 --> 21:13.140
It doesn't matter if our future is bright or gloomy.

21:14.070 --> 21:15.570
In this transformative era,

21:16.240 --> 21:17.860
there are only two possible outcomes.

21:19.400 --> 21:19.980
One,

21:20.750 --> 21:21.660
you march forward.

21:22.640 --> 21:23.330
Two,

21:24.070 --> 21:25.420
you're sacrificed in the name of evolution.

21:26.830 --> 21:27.660
I want to know

21:28.590 --> 21:29.940
what we will choose.

21:32.160 --> 21:33.530
Our choices

21:34.680 --> 21:35.940
depend on our personalities.

21:36.790 --> 21:37.090
No.

21:38.110 --> 21:39.570
It's not a choice at all.

21:40.720 --> 21:42.220
Our destiny dictates

21:42.880 --> 21:44.770
if we survive or if we are sacrificed.

21:48.400 --> 21:49.220
I don't believe in destiny.

21:51.000 --> 21:52.220
Tiezui said

21:52.590 --> 21:53.220
he could never predict

21:53.590 --> 21:54.380
my fate accurately.

21:57.720 --> 21:58.980
Well, I'm not too worried

21:59.030 --> 22:00.330
about those who sacrifice themselves.

22:01.550 --> 22:02.730
We, as a nation,

22:03.510 --> 22:04.700
are never lacking

22:04.720 --> 22:05.900
in brave, selfless souls.

22:06.920 --> 22:08.050
Time after time,

22:08.920 --> 22:10.460
history has proven

22:10.640 --> 22:12.250
that those who invaded our land

22:12.750 --> 22:15.140
always underestimated our sacrifices and resilience.

22:16.480 --> 22:17.770
I'm more worried

22:20.440 --> 22:22.180
about the ones who march forward.

22:23.590 --> 22:24.860
With so many

22:25.400 --> 22:26.980
sacrificed lives on their shoulders,

22:28.640 --> 22:29.900
their journey will be lonely.

22:30.510 --> 22:31.330
Very lonely.

22:32.480 --> 22:33.490
If you take the path for long enough,

22:34.510 --> 22:35.810
you no longer feel lonely.

22:38.350 --> 22:39.530
If a war breaks out,

22:40.750 --> 22:42.330
I will be there at the defense line

22:43.310 --> 22:44.250
and never back down.

22:48.940 --> 22:52.540
[Beiping]

22:53.100 --> 22:57.110
[Station Exit]

22:57.110 --> 22:58.620
Breaking news!

22:58.720 --> 23:01.860
Stabbed in public. Attacker is still at large.

23:01.960 --> 23:03.380
Breaking news!

23:03.480 --> 23:05.290
- Attacker is still at large. - Newsboy.

23:07.260 --> 23:09.140
[Judge Shen of High Court Stabbed, Attacker is Still At Large]

23:09.140 --> 23:10.620
[Shot thrice]

23:10.880 --> 23:12.250
Breaking news!

23:12.310 --> 23:13.880
Judge Shen of High Court

23:13.880 --> 23:15.430
- stabbed in public. - Proceed with the plan.

23:15.480 --> 23:17.180
Attacker is still at large.

23:17.820 --> 23:21.980
[Yahe Monthly]

23:30.270 --> 23:31.290
Has the budget been approved?

23:34.260 --> 23:35.110
[Chief Editor's Office]

23:35.110 --> 23:35.620
Chief Editor,

23:36.240 --> 23:38.250
our budget this time is only half

23:38.590 --> 23:39.660
of our previous budget.

23:39.700 --> 23:42.550
[Liang Bencai]

23:42.550 --> 23:42.940
Half?

23:45.510 --> 23:47.490
That won't be enough to get us a private cabin.

23:49.590 --> 23:50.250
What is happening?

23:50.680 --> 23:51.290
I have no idea.

23:56.310 --> 23:57.220
Did they find someone new

23:57.270 --> 23:59.050
to help them with the auction?

24:02.160 --> 24:03.180
The Japanese

24:04.240 --> 24:05.090
blow hot

24:05.160 --> 24:06.180
and cold.

24:08.400 --> 24:09.620
How are we supposed to work like that?

24:10.640 --> 24:11.090
Chief Editor,

24:11.920 --> 24:13.560
perhaps they noticed

24:14.200 --> 24:15.730
what we did to the goods last time?

24:19.240 --> 24:20.050
As if they could find out.

24:21.350 --> 24:22.290
If they did,

24:22.400 --> 24:23.380
we wouldn't be alive now.

24:25.680 --> 24:26.140
Get out.

24:26.340 --> 24:32.020
[Chief Editor's Office]

24:38.860 --> 24:45.100
[Yahe Monthly Publishing House]

24:45.100 --> 24:46.180
[Agent ID]

24:47.260 --> 24:49.780
[Agent ID]

24:49.960 --> 24:50.460
Sir,

24:51.350 --> 24:52.140
according to our rules,

24:52.270 --> 24:54.460
you need to register your name and your unit.

24:54.960 --> 24:55.980
It won't take long.

24:56.110 --> 24:56.810
Just a few notes will do.

24:56.920 --> 24:57.730
Forgive us.

25:05.200 --> 25:08.050
Which branch are you from?

25:14.110 --> 25:15.770
[Sasaki]
Where are you from?

25:16.350 --> 25:17.090
I'm asking you a question.

25:17.480 --> 25:18.220
What's taking you so long to answer?

25:18.510 --> 25:20.090
Receptionist, notify the guards outside.

25:20.270 --> 25:21.530
Frisk them and find out who they are.

25:23.240 --> 25:24.250
Sasaki?

25:25.830 --> 25:28.140
You don't recognize me?

25:30.640 --> 25:32.770
That summer in the Military Academy?

25:34.720 --> 25:38.140
I'm so glad you're here in Beiping.

25:39.270 --> 25:41.140
Over there in Tianjin,

25:41.160 --> 25:42.940
we have to check on the transport line all day long.

25:43.350 --> 25:46.200
They ask me to write 10 reports when I want a bit of coal.

25:46.200 --> 25:47.420
It's unbelievable.

25:49.750 --> 25:50.250
Camel cigarettes.

25:51.110 --> 25:53.490
Plenty of them in the train.

25:55.960 --> 25:59.460
You're doing so well now.

26:00.830 --> 26:02.570
Sorry, sir.

26:04.510 --> 26:06.180
Just an old friend of mine.

26:07.000 --> 26:10.250
This is Officer Yamamoto from the Investigation Branch.

26:11.640 --> 26:13.530
Hi, Officer Yamamoto.

26:16.550 --> 26:19.220
We still have work to do.

26:20.200 --> 26:21.620
We have to see someone at the publishing house

26:21.790 --> 26:23.900
to hand over an approved copy.

26:35.070 --> 26:36.940
Let's catch up another time.

26:43.070 --> 26:44.440
Who is he?

26:45.750 --> 26:47.530
How come I don't remember him?

26:47.980 --> 26:48.780
[Yahe Monthly]

26:53.000 --> 26:53.530
Master Zhang.

26:53.680 --> 26:55.140
Pick up some Japanese if you can.

26:55.440 --> 26:56.490
Just in case.

26:59.790 --> 27:02.010
Don't tell me the higher-up doesn't trust me.

27:03.270 --> 27:05.730
I can explain in person.

27:05.880 --> 27:08.140
There must be a misunderstanding.

27:11.510 --> 27:12.380
Who are you?

27:13.640 --> 27:16.570
Question him. I'll look around.

27:17.440 --> 27:17.900
Yes.

27:21.440 --> 27:24.010
I am from the Mantetsu Investigation Branch.

27:24.590 --> 27:25.860
Mr. Liang,

27:26.070 --> 27:29.290
I need to ask you something.

27:39.720 --> 27:40.460
Do you have a Letter of Introduction?

27:41.310 --> 27:43.050
You will not be entertained without an official document.

27:43.590 --> 27:47.140
I am the legal representative of a Japanese company.

27:48.070 --> 27:49.250
According to the agreement,

27:49.350 --> 27:51.220
I have exclusive jurisdiction over internal affairs.

27:51.590 --> 27:52.620
Do not touch that.

27:53.440 --> 27:54.900
It belongs to the Empire of Japan.

28:01.070 --> 28:02.490
We know what you did

28:03.270 --> 28:05.570
to the previous batch of goods.

28:06.590 --> 28:07.420
We just need

28:08.030 --> 28:09.900
to find out if you're colluding with your superior.

28:11.070 --> 28:12.290
We aren't sure

28:13.350 --> 28:15.050
so we won't alert the rest yet.

28:17.200 --> 28:18.770
I don't know what you're talking about.

28:23.640 --> 28:24.140
The goods

28:25.750 --> 28:26.620
are still here.

28:27.920 --> 28:28.380
Right?

28:32.750 --> 28:35.090
Maybe it can still be salvaged.

28:36.240 --> 28:37.900
You either bring us the authentic goods,

28:38.720 --> 28:42.530
or tell us the mastermind

28:42.550 --> 28:43.700
behind you.

28:44.350 --> 28:47.330
Then, we might just keep you here.

28:52.880 --> 28:53.490
Really?

28:55.920 --> 28:56.700
Therefore,

28:58.350 --> 28:59.290
we will confiscate

29:00.750 --> 29:02.810
your right to attend the auction in Xinyue Restaurant.

29:04.070 --> 29:05.570
We will attend it on your behalf.

29:06.350 --> 29:07.980
To avoid drawing unnecessary attention,

29:08.550 --> 29:09.700
you should stay here.

29:10.830 --> 29:12.940
We will bid according to your protocol

29:13.200 --> 29:14.090
and submit the goods.

29:14.400 --> 29:15.010
Understood?

29:17.000 --> 29:17.940
I want to make a call.

29:20.160 --> 29:20.980
Sure.

29:22.720 --> 29:24.220
You have two choices.

29:25.480 --> 29:25.980
One.

29:26.640 --> 29:27.570
Make the call

29:28.400 --> 29:29.900
and bring us the embezzled money.

29:31.200 --> 29:31.660
Two.

29:32.920 --> 29:35.570
Call your superior, Tottori.

29:36.310 --> 29:38.660
Ask him what you should do now.

29:40.830 --> 29:41.620
Mr. Liang,

29:42.640 --> 29:43.620
surely you know

29:44.240 --> 29:46.090
that your line is bugged.

29:47.480 --> 29:49.010
Please don't make things more difficult for us.

30:00.960 --> 30:02.810
Fine. Let's do as you wish.

30:05.960 --> 30:07.460
One more thing.

30:08.750 --> 30:10.770
I need to use your car downstairs.

30:11.720 --> 30:12.730
No problem.

30:14.440 --> 30:15.700
And your attire.

30:17.550 --> 30:18.660
Careful. It's hot.

30:18.720 --> 30:19.090
Okay.

30:21.000 --> 30:21.420
Come.

30:21.830 --> 30:22.290
Master Zhang.

30:23.000 --> 30:23.810
No extra spicy.

30:41.590 --> 30:43.050
We got the first invitation letter.

30:43.480 --> 30:46.330
Things in Beiping are more tense than we imagined.

30:46.790 --> 30:48.290
We must be extra cautious.

30:49.000 --> 30:49.940
Also, I need another favor

30:50.720 --> 30:51.660
from all of you.

30:52.830 --> 30:53.420
Go ahead.

30:53.880 --> 30:54.860
As you all know,

30:55.480 --> 30:56.220
my wife

30:56.640 --> 30:57.810
is from Xinyue Restaurant.

30:58.590 --> 30:59.770
You might assume that they

31:00.510 --> 31:01.490
will be more lenient to me.

31:02.550 --> 31:03.900
But to them,

31:04.350 --> 31:05.220
rules are rules.

31:05.680 --> 31:07.530
I broke the biggest rule when I took

31:07.750 --> 31:08.570
Luhuo Grass last time.

31:09.480 --> 31:10.980
My wife implored and begged them.

31:11.640 --> 31:13.330
Hence, they didn't hunt me down.

31:13.590 --> 31:15.380
But there is also a new rule now.

31:15.720 --> 31:17.220
If I enter Xinyue Restaurant again,

31:17.350 --> 31:17.980
I'll be killed.

31:19.400 --> 31:20.900
They must be joking.

31:22.270 --> 31:22.810
Joking?

31:23.440 --> 31:24.220
Zhang Qishan.

31:24.220 --> 31:24.790
[To Zhang Qishan]

31:24.790 --> 31:26.530
The greatest mercy I can afford

31:26.750 --> 31:28.900
is that you shall never enter Xinyue Restaurant again.

31:29.720 --> 31:31.380
As the leader of the Mystic Nine,

31:31.400 --> 31:32.810
I'm sure you are a man of your word.

31:33.400 --> 31:34.420
If you enter

31:34.750 --> 31:35.900
the restaurant again,

31:35.960 --> 31:38.010
you're disrespecting the centuries of legacy we have.

31:38.960 --> 31:40.460
Our ally behind the scenes

31:40.510 --> 31:41.980
will not spare you.

31:42.750 --> 31:44.380
Their ally behind the scenes?

31:45.160 --> 31:46.180
Who are they?

31:46.440 --> 31:47.490
I have no idea.

31:48.400 --> 31:49.900
Xinyue Restaurant has stood for centuries.

31:50.200 --> 31:51.050
They are mysterious.

31:52.350 --> 31:53.860
So other than the Yin Clan who runs the place,

31:54.310 --> 31:55.860
Xinyue Restaurant also has support

31:55.960 --> 31:56.810
behind the scenes.

31:56.880 --> 31:58.380
If we barge in,

31:58.720 --> 32:01.330
even your wife won't keep us alive.

32:02.030 --> 32:03.570
And Mr. Yin will have no choice

32:03.790 --> 32:04.810
but to kill me.

32:08.510 --> 32:09.140
Therefore,

32:09.480 --> 32:11.490
we cannot blow our cover.

32:12.070 --> 32:12.980
Especially you.

32:13.000 --> 32:14.980
The poisonous needles on the polearms will kill you immediately.

32:15.110 --> 32:15.940
There is no cure.

32:16.160 --> 32:17.140
Your martial prowess

32:17.640 --> 32:18.530
is not enough to save you.

32:21.440 --> 32:22.660
We must do it flawlessly

32:23.000 --> 32:24.140
to escape.

32:25.480 --> 32:27.220
So, I'll die from one prick?

32:28.030 --> 32:28.810
Yes.

32:32.350 --> 32:34.090
Any other caveats, Master Zhang?

32:35.270 --> 32:35.980
Ear slaves

32:36.200 --> 32:37.090
will be there to monitor the whole place.

32:37.200 --> 32:38.700
We'll speak in Changsha tongue.

32:40.790 --> 32:41.810
Let me reiterate.

32:42.270 --> 32:44.770
The second invitation letter is on a Jiangxi native

32:45.480 --> 32:47.220
called Xiong Lichang.

32:47.790 --> 32:49.460
He lives in Zhengyang Pavilion.

32:51.240 --> 32:52.140
Proceed with the plan.

32:52.640 --> 32:53.530
Chen Pi, Heibei.

32:53.680 --> 32:54.380
I count on you two.

32:59.240 --> 33:00.770
Do not kill anyone unless you have to.

33:01.880 --> 33:02.220
Master Zhang.

33:03.070 --> 33:04.570
I can withdraw the money myself.

33:04.920 --> 33:06.380
Stinky Yu can assist Chen Pi and Heibei.

33:07.550 --> 33:08.620
We stick to the original plan.

33:10.640 --> 33:11.490
Let's get changed.

33:29.550 --> 33:30.570
Are you feeling better?

33:32.880 --> 33:34.090
The new medicine this time

33:34.440 --> 33:35.620
should be quite effective.

33:36.550 --> 33:38.660
You will be cured soon.

33:39.480 --> 33:40.900
You're funny, Mr. Tottori.

33:41.480 --> 33:42.940
Knowing you,

33:43.640 --> 33:44.770
my full recovery

33:45.400 --> 33:47.140
will ruin your empire's plan.

33:49.000 --> 33:49.940
It will not be cured

33:50.000 --> 33:52.180
in the foreseeable future.

33:53.790 --> 33:55.090
We, the Japanese, do not extort

33:55.200 --> 33:57.220
our allies with diseases.

33:57.750 --> 33:58.660
We will

33:59.640 --> 34:00.730
get what we're after eventually.

34:01.640 --> 34:03.810
Using dirty tricks like this is beneath us.

34:08.190 --> 34:09.380
We shall see

34:10.000 --> 34:12.380
if your doctors can cure me.

34:19.030 --> 34:19.900
You know

34:20.630 --> 34:21.900
that my gentleness toward you

34:23.280 --> 34:25.090
is not pure business.

34:27.110 --> 34:28.610
Shouldn't you be afraid of the consequences?

34:29.510 --> 34:31.940
Your government has never been kind to soldiers

34:33.840 --> 34:35.050
who mix work with pleasure.

34:35.550 --> 34:36.900
And I am willing

34:38.400 --> 34:39.460
to serve the punishment.

34:40.960 --> 34:42.780
Many men have told me the same thing.

34:45.110 --> 34:47.010
I don't need you to be the hopeless romantic.

34:47.590 --> 34:48.530
Let's

34:49.280 --> 34:50.490
keep our relationship simple.

34:50.840 --> 34:51.300
Sure.

34:52.230 --> 34:53.210
Let's keep it simple.

34:54.630 --> 34:55.610
I'll cure you.

34:56.670 --> 34:58.780
Then, you can choose what to do.

35:00.710 --> 35:01.780
I just don't want to see you

35:02.400 --> 35:03.610
die from such a disease.

35:07.440 --> 35:09.340
You'll have to work harder then, Mr. Tottori.

35:13.030 --> 35:15.300
I'm not done enjoying the air in Changsha.

35:16.800 --> 35:18.340
I don't want to die in Beiping.

35:28.510 --> 35:29.010
Sir,

35:29.590 --> 35:31.940
why did Banjie Li ask to see you all of a sudden?

35:33.800 --> 35:35.260
He is up to something.

35:36.360 --> 35:38.610
One moment, Zhang Qishan had Xie Jiu transferred away.

35:39.230 --> 35:40.300
The next moment,

35:40.590 --> 35:41.570
Banjie Li's invitation letter

35:41.590 --> 35:42.740
was on my desk.

35:43.070 --> 35:44.690
That's too much of a coincidence.

35:46.920 --> 35:47.980
Have you found out

35:48.070 --> 35:49.650
where Zhang Qishan brought Xie Jiu?

35:50.280 --> 35:51.050
I just received news

35:51.400 --> 35:53.980
that Xie Jiu went to Beiping.

35:54.320 --> 35:57.340
Zhang Qishan has not been seen in Changsha for the last few days either.

35:57.800 --> 35:58.610
One more thing,

35:58.920 --> 36:00.050
there will be an auction

36:00.320 --> 36:01.740
in Xinyue Restaurant of Beiping soon.

36:05.400 --> 36:06.530
Zhang Qishan.

36:07.480 --> 36:08.170
Xie Jiu.

36:09.280 --> 36:10.490
Xinyue Restaurant.

36:14.480 --> 36:16.900
There's no way Zhang Qishan brought Xie Jiu

36:16.960 --> 36:18.690
to Beiping for just an auction.

36:20.760 --> 36:22.650
Regardless of their plan,

36:23.800 --> 36:25.650
Banjie Li must have asked to see me now

36:26.510 --> 36:29.090
because it has something to do with their plan in Beiping.

36:30.630 --> 36:32.420
Sir, should we still see him then?

36:33.000 --> 36:34.690
Of course.

36:35.630 --> 36:36.860
Banjie Li

36:37.480 --> 36:39.570
is usually a selfish lone wolf.

36:40.280 --> 36:42.780
This time, he asked to see me because of Zhang Qishan.

36:44.400 --> 36:45.340
I'm curious

36:45.400 --> 36:47.170
to see what he is up to.

36:50.510 --> 36:51.460
Cigarettes!

36:51.510 --> 36:52.210
Listen.

36:52.550 --> 36:53.960
[Liuchaoju Tea House]
Tell the owner

36:53.960 --> 36:55.570
what I just told you.

36:56.000 --> 36:57.460
You'll be able to close the deal.

36:57.960 --> 36:58.650
Are you sure?

36:58.960 --> 37:00.050
Yes. Just trust me.

37:06.840 --> 37:07.570
Officer Huo.

37:07.570 --> 37:08.680
Cigarettes!

37:09.280 --> 37:10.520
Cigarettes!

37:20.320 --> 37:20.940
Officer Huo.

37:21.710 --> 37:22.340
Second floor, please.

37:35.510 --> 37:37.010
When did you return, Officer Huo?

37:40.030 --> 37:41.460
Third Master, your men are everywhere.

37:42.280 --> 37:43.920
I'm sure you were notified the moment

37:43.920 --> 37:45.090
I stepped into Changsha City.

37:48.670 --> 37:49.940
You came back a long time ago,

37:50.670 --> 37:52.340
but you haven't visited the Huo Clan.

37:58.150 --> 37:59.460
One

37:59.510 --> 38:00.940
should never forget his roots.

38:02.670 --> 38:03.690
What do you want from me?

38:04.920 --> 38:05.420
Nothing.

38:06.960 --> 38:08.130
Just catching up.

38:09.630 --> 38:10.460
You

38:11.000 --> 38:12.090
have become so successful.

38:13.800 --> 38:15.260
I wish to get some of your good luck.

38:16.670 --> 38:17.050
Come.

38:18.280 --> 38:20.860
I ordered the meal specially for you, Officer Huo.

38:22.400 --> 38:23.050
Dig in.

38:24.880 --> 38:25.740
Don't let me take up more of your time.

38:29.510 --> 38:29.980
Let's go.

38:38.840 --> 38:39.340
Oh.

38:42.670 --> 38:44.340
I almost forgot I have another gift for you.

38:50.670 --> 38:51.260
Keep it safe.

38:56.630 --> 38:57.050
Let's go.

39:04.320 --> 39:07.740
Sir, are we still eating?

39:24.630 --> 39:26.090
Banjie Li is so arrogant.

39:26.630 --> 39:27.130
Sir.

39:27.590 --> 39:28.690
He threatened you.

39:29.280 --> 39:30.650
I'll have him arrested now.

39:31.630 --> 39:33.650
Do you want me to die today or what?

39:34.630 --> 39:35.530
He stole my gun

39:35.550 --> 39:36.940
right under my nose.

39:37.150 --> 39:38.490
Killing me is just a piece of cake to him.

39:39.190 --> 39:40.740
Will he ever hurt someone from the Ministry of War though?

39:42.110 --> 39:43.130
Before this,

39:44.110 --> 39:45.380
perhaps no.

39:46.110 --> 39:47.530
But what he did just now

39:48.840 --> 39:50.050
implies

39:51.110 --> 39:51.980
that he's ready

39:52.000 --> 39:53.650
to fight me to the death.

39:55.760 --> 39:56.690
Zhang Qishan.

39:58.920 --> 40:00.460
I don't know what he told the rest

40:00.630 --> 40:02.170
in the meeting last time.

40:02.480 --> 40:04.380
But if the Mystic Nine is now

40:04.440 --> 40:05.210
working together,

40:06.510 --> 40:07.980
we will have a terrible time

40:08.000 --> 40:09.420
in Changsha.

40:09.710 --> 40:10.980
What should we do next?

40:16.550 --> 40:17.900
Forget about Beiping.

40:19.150 --> 40:20.780
Banjie Li will spy on us for sure.

40:22.230 --> 40:24.460
We might as well just play along and let them think

40:25.510 --> 40:26.570
that we have given up.

40:27.230 --> 40:29.860
However, we can't sit around idly either.

40:30.360 --> 40:31.300
If

40:31.360 --> 40:33.420
the Mystic Nine is all intertwined like a knot,

40:34.030 --> 40:35.650
I'll just find another blade.

40:36.190 --> 40:37.530
Another blade

40:39.000 --> 40:40.170
that can slice through the knot.

40:45.300 --> 40:48.040
[Hengyuantong Bank]

40:48.040 --> 40:49.260
Make way.

40:49.440 --> 40:50.460
We're all in the Mystic Nine,

40:50.800 --> 40:51.690
but the Xie Clan sure is rich.

40:52.360 --> 40:53.210
Even though

40:53.230 --> 40:54.820
the money will belong to Xinyue Restaurant after tonight,

40:55.230 --> 40:55.940
in the end,

40:56.510 --> 40:58.050
it will still go to Master Zhang and his wife.

41:03.480 --> 41:04.210
Master Zhang?

41:04.630 --> 41:06.610
You shouldn't drive. That's beneath you.

41:06.670 --> 41:07.650
Come down now.

41:12.590 --> 41:13.740
Master Zhang, you...

41:14.110 --> 41:14.940
Is there a problem?

41:17.070 --> 41:17.980
I was about to say

41:18.480 --> 41:19.980
that with your current attire,

41:20.360 --> 41:21.170
you look

41:21.760 --> 41:22.860
like a gentleman who studied

41:22.880 --> 41:24.490
in Japan for a few years.

41:26.630 --> 41:27.090
Eighth Master,

41:27.960 --> 41:29.340
even if you're wearing an emperor's robe,

41:29.670 --> 41:31.610
you'll still look like a random performer

41:31.630 --> 41:32.460
in Second Master's opera.

41:34.590 --> 41:35.260
Stinky Yu.

41:35.400 --> 41:37.380
Of all things you could have learned in Beiping,

41:37.630 --> 41:39.210
you learned how to insult others.

41:39.230 --> 41:39.900
Hop in.

41:41.320 --> 41:43.420
Master Zhang, it's time you change

41:43.880 --> 41:44.900
your chauffeur.

41:45.360 --> 41:46.090
For all you know,

41:46.480 --> 41:47.740
he might bite someone else

41:48.670 --> 41:50.980
and you have to foot the medical bill.

41:57.110 --> 41:57.460
Master Zhang.

41:58.000 --> 41:59.130
You're wearing a changshan, not a military uniform.

42:00.230 --> 42:01.130
No need to be so uptight.

42:02.150 --> 42:03.050
Relax

42:03.510 --> 42:05.050
to display your suaveness.

42:07.150 --> 42:09.010
Speak for yourself, Xie Jiu.

42:09.960 --> 42:11.010
You have always

42:11.590 --> 42:12.780
been very cautious.

42:13.110 --> 42:14.690
But you're distraught today.

42:25.920 --> 42:26.900
I haven't gone out for a while.

42:28.000 --> 42:28.900
The confinement of my residence

42:30.070 --> 42:30.940
has made me inattentive.

42:34.400 --> 42:34.980
Let me help you.

42:35.840 --> 42:36.300
Master Zhang.

42:37.320 --> 42:38.980
Sixth Master and Fourth Master are both cranky.

42:39.800 --> 42:40.690
Is it okay for them

42:40.840 --> 42:41.860
to work together?

42:45.880 --> 42:47.050
We'll find out soon.

42:47.660 --> 42:49.300
[World for Everyone]

42:54.300 --> 42:56.480
[Xinyue Restaurant]

42:56.480 --> 42:57.420
Hi. Invitation letter, please.

42:59.280 --> 42:59.740
Thank you.

43:01.900 --> 43:10.420
[Beiping Branch of the Military Affairs Commission]

43:14.400 --> 43:14.940
Welcome.

43:15.440 --> 43:15.860
Come.

43:15.860 --> 43:20.580
[Yahe Monthly]

43:49.000 --> 43:53.170
Beiping's Opium King, Tian Zuocheng, proof of funds, approved.

43:57.400 --> 44:00.940
Jiangxi's Vinegar Tycoon, Xiong Lichang, proof of funds, approved.

44:16.800 --> 44:17.300
Hello.

44:22.710 --> 44:26.780
Liang Bencai of Yahe Monthly, proof of funds, approved.

44:41.500 --> 44:42.500
[Xinyue Restaurant]

44:42.510 --> 44:44.940
This is almost identical to Xinyue Restaurant.

44:46.670 --> 44:48.420
Even though it's the Military Affairs Commission,

44:49.320 --> 44:50.690
the interior of it is directly taken

44:50.710 --> 44:52.740
from Xinyue Restaurant.

44:53.510 --> 44:55.170
If there is war,

44:55.280 --> 44:58.130
can the entire building be moved to another province?

44:59.230 --> 45:00.780
Only a few know how to dismantle

45:01.400 --> 45:03.260
and assemble it.

45:14.110 --> 45:16.820
The ones over there are from Kinmen Shipping.

45:17.670 --> 45:19.740
They prospect gold in Nanyang.

45:20.800 --> 45:22.340
The one with the hat

45:22.920 --> 45:24.380
is the biggest medicine supplier in Fengtian.

45:25.110 --> 45:26.940
To our right, the father and son duo

45:27.550 --> 45:29.530
are the Dongs from Jiangyou's Saltery.

45:31.030 --> 45:32.610
All of the visitors here

45:32.960 --> 45:35.530
are no ordinary folk.

45:36.590 --> 45:37.900
They are individual bidders.

45:39.070 --> 45:41.690
The powerful ones are in the private cabins.

45:42.360 --> 45:43.010
Follow me.

45:44.800 --> 45:46.690
Their guards are very strong.

45:46.840 --> 45:48.610
Almost as strong as the Mystic Nine.

46:09.800 --> 46:10.780
I heard

46:11.150 --> 46:11.980
there are many

46:12.000 --> 46:13.980
rare gems in the auction today.

46:14.670 --> 46:16.010
Miss Huo, pick anything you like.

46:16.920 --> 46:17.940
Don't worry about the budget.

46:19.480 --> 46:20.420
Mr. Tottori,

46:20.440 --> 46:22.340
are you planning to seize

46:22.880 --> 46:24.380
every treasure from my nation?

46:25.480 --> 46:26.610
You have the wrong idea, Miss Huo.

46:27.510 --> 46:28.380
The Japanese

46:28.960 --> 46:31.820
want to be friends with everyone in Asia.

46:32.550 --> 46:35.980
Instead of letting these relics be destroyed in war

46:36.710 --> 46:38.260
or thrown away by those who don't know

46:38.440 --> 46:39.460
to appreciate them,

46:41.070 --> 46:42.570
they are much safer

46:43.230 --> 46:44.380
in our hands.

46:47.440 --> 46:48.010
Let's go up.

47:12.960 --> 47:13.530
Chief Editor Liang.

47:13.760 --> 47:15.400
These are the gold bars as exchanged with your assets.

47:15.590 --> 47:17.740
After the auction, you can exchange the remainder for silver certificates.

47:19.180 --> 47:21.180
[Private Room One]

47:37.960 --> 47:38.490
Miss Huo,

47:38.880 --> 47:40.010
the chief auctioneer prepared

47:40.070 --> 47:41.340
this fruit platter for you.

47:41.710 --> 47:42.650
Much appreciated. Put it there.

47:46.510 --> 47:47.260
Mr. Tottori.

48:06.190 --> 48:06.780
Miss Huo.

48:08.000 --> 48:09.010
What is the meaning of this?

48:09.630 --> 48:10.980
I'm the consultant you hired.

48:11.840 --> 48:12.650
Not your female companion.

48:21.760 --> 48:22.380
I can view

48:22.400 --> 48:24.210
the auction items better from this angle.

48:25.590 --> 48:28.490
Miss Huo, your tie with Xinyue Restaurant

48:29.110 --> 48:30.420
runs deeper than I thought.

48:31.510 --> 48:32.420
So you...

48:47.400 --> 48:48.490
In today's auction,

48:49.230 --> 48:51.340
other than us, there is also

48:51.760 --> 48:53.900
Chief Editor of Yahe Monthly, Liang Bencai.

48:54.230 --> 48:55.780
To avoid overspending,

48:55.920 --> 48:57.050
we need a strategy.

48:57.230 --> 48:59.490
I'll invite him over later.

49:00.190 --> 49:01.340
You can talk to him.

49:01.800 --> 49:02.690
We'll do as you wish.

49:11.030 --> 49:12.210
The security here is tight.

49:12.670 --> 49:14.530
No one can do anything recklessly.

49:14.760 --> 49:16.740
I hope everything goes well later.

49:18.760 --> 49:19.530
Mr. Liang,

49:19.800 --> 49:21.740
Mr. Torii Tottori of Private Room 1

49:21.800 --> 49:22.940
invites you for a chat.

49:23.150 --> 49:25.010
He wants to introduce a new friend to you.

49:25.840 --> 49:26.820
Mr. Tottori?

49:27.360 --> 49:29.300
What is he doing here?

49:29.480 --> 49:31.130
I'm not sure.

49:34.400 --> 49:36.210
I should've checked my fortune before I left.

49:36.230 --> 49:37.780
I can't believe Torii Tottori is here.

49:38.110 --> 49:39.010
He wants to see you.

49:39.230 --> 49:40.570
We can only leave now.

49:41.550 --> 49:42.300
Or,

49:43.150 --> 49:44.570
Torii Tottori

49:44.920 --> 49:46.090
has never

49:46.710 --> 49:48.010
met Liang Bencai before.

49:50.230 --> 49:52.460
Liang Bencai is just a lowly chief editor

49:52.760 --> 49:53.610
of a fake monthly magazine.

49:53.960 --> 49:56.780
It's possible that they have never met each other.

49:57.710 --> 49:58.780
And if they have?

50:02.150 --> 50:03.860
If they have met each other before,

50:04.480 --> 50:06.090
I'll have to kill Torii Tottori.

50:06.840 --> 50:07.940
If a high-ranking Japanese officer

50:08.030 --> 50:09.490
is killed in the Military Affairs Commission,

50:09.960 --> 50:11.260
that will be a diplomatic crisis.

50:11.710 --> 50:14.690
I don't want to implicate Xinyue restaurant in this.

50:15.440 --> 50:17.610
I'll bear the consequences alone.

50:18.030 --> 50:18.820
It seems like

50:20.480 --> 50:21.980
you'll have to meet him.

50:46.380 --> 50:50.540
♪The past fades like smoke♪

50:50.900 --> 50:53.620
♪A choice is made in silence♪

50:53.900 --> 50:56.700
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

50:57.100 --> 51:00.860
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

51:01.100 --> 51:04.540
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

51:04.820 --> 51:08.220
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

51:08.300 --> 51:15.580
♪But this could be our last trip together♪

51:16.020 --> 51:19.300
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

51:19.580 --> 51:22.820
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

51:22.980 --> 51:27.020
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

51:27.220 --> 51:30.580
♪Who believes in fate?♪

51:30.820 --> 51:34.180
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

51:34.420 --> 51:37.700
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

51:38.020 --> 51:41.700
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

51:41.900 --> 51:45.140
♪Take care♪

51:45.140 --> 51:47.700
♪We once raced♪

51:47.780 --> 51:49.700
♪For the dawn♪

51:49.860 --> 51:53.140
♪Ever-lasting bond, a satisfying vindication♪

51:53.260 --> 51:56.540
♪In the web of fate♪

51:56.540 --> 51:59.740
♪No one can escape♪

52:00.740 --> 52:02.580
♪Life and death cut like a blade♪

52:02.740 --> 52:04.300
♪We too were young once♪

52:04.380 --> 52:07.820
♪Fortunate to brave the raging waves together♪

52:08.020 --> 52:10.340
♪Keep the ember lit♪

52:10.460 --> 52:14.980
♪To illuminate the journey ahead♪

52:15.100 --> 52:18.060
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

52:18.300 --> 52:21.820
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

52:21.940 --> 52:25.700
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

52:26.020 --> 52:29.500
♪Who believes in fate?♪

52:29.660 --> 52:32.660
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

52:32.900 --> 52:36.660
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

52:36.820 --> 52:40.540
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

52:40.660 --> 52:52.100
♪Please, do take care of yourself♪
